to facilitate training of teachers in colleges and Universities ;
(v)
to develop programmes for greater academic co-operation and interaction between University teachers and College
teachers and to facilitate mobility of students and teachers within and outside the State ;
(vi)
to conduct entrance examination for admission to institutions of higher education and render advice on admissions ;
(vii)
to encourage sports, games, physical education and cultural activities in the Universities and Colleges ;
(viii)
to encourage extension activities and promote interaction with agencies concerned with regional planning and
